---
import Base from '../../../../layouts/Base.astro';

// /metadax/guide/no-ai/ -- the web questionnaire route. The form itself lives at
// /metadax/homeschool/start/. It saves and sends nothing; it builds a short note
// you copy and send. A page comes back, free. No package is produced here.
---
<Base title="No AI? Use the Meta DAX questionnaire" description="Answer about a dozen short questions on the web, copy the note it makes, and send it. A lesson page comes back, free. Nothing is saved or sent from the page itself." wide>
  <section class="lede">
    <p class="eyebrow"><a href="/metadax/">Meta DAX</a> &rsaquo; <a href="/metadax/guide/">Help</a> &rsaquo; No AI</p>
    <h1>No AI? Use the questionnaire</h1>
    <p class="lede-text">
      You do not need an AI subscription, or any AI at all. Fill in a short web
      form, copy the note it makes, and send it. A lesson page is built for you and
      comes back, free.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="block" aria-labelledby="h-open">
    <h2 id="h-open">1. Open the questionnaire</h2>
    <p class="body">It is one page on this site:</p>
    <p class="out"><a href="/metadax/homeschool/start/">Tell us where your child is stuck &rarr;</a></p>
  </section>

  <section class="block" aria-labelledby="h-fill">
    <h2 id="h-fill">2. Answer about a dozen questions</h2>
    <p class="body">
      Plain words, no sign-up: a nickname for your child (or leave it blank and the
      page just says &ldquo;you&rdquo;), a rough age, the subject, the exact spot
      where it keeps going wrong, a real wrong answer if you have one, and what they
      love. Please leave out names, schools, towns and health details; the page
      warns you if something looks like a name, email or phone number.
    </p>
    <p class="body">
      Teaching more than one child the same lesson? Say how many, and give each a
      nickname and a rough age in one go.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="block" aria-labelledby="h-send">
    <h2 id="h-send">3. Copy the note and send it</h2>
    <p class="body">
      Press <strong>Make my note</strong> and the page builds a short, plain note
      from your answers. Copy it and send it back where you found Meta DAX, or to
      Jason on <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jasonjeyanandan">LinkedIn</a>.
      That note is everything that gets sent &mdash; the page itself saves nothing
      and sends nothing on its own.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="block" aria-labelledby="h-back">
    <h2 id="h-back">4. A page comes back</h2>
    <p class="body">
      You are sent a lesson page like the samples on the site: one side for you, one
      side made for your child, built through what they love. You read it before
      your child does. Then tell us how it went, and the next one comes back shaped
      by it.
    </p>
    <p class="out">
      <a href="/metadax/homeschool/">See a sample first &rarr;</a>
      <span aria-hidden="true">&middot;</span>
      <a href="/metadax/guide/claude-skill/">Rather build it yourself? Use the Claude skill</a>
      <span aria-hidden="true">&middot;</span>
      <a href="/metadax/guide/">Back to the guide</a>
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .lede { padding-block: 3rem 2rem; }
  .eyebrow { margin: 0 0 1rem; font-size: 0.8125rem; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); }
  .eyebrow a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
  .eyebrow a:hover, .eyebrow a:focus-visible { color: var(--fg); }
  h1 { margin: 0 0 1.25rem; font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 1.2rem + 2.6vw, 2.75rem); font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.22; letter-spacing: -0.012em; max-width: 20em; text-wrap: balance; }
  .lede-text { margin: 0; max-width: 40em; color: #cfcfcf; }

  .block { padding-block: 2.5rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); scroll-margin-top: 1.5rem; }
  h2 { margin: 0 0 1.25rem; font-size: 0.8125rem; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); }
  strong { font-weight: 600; color: var(--fg); }
  .body { margin: 0; max-width: 40em; color: #cfcfcf; }
  .body + .body, .body + .out, .out + .body { margin-top: 1rem; }
  .body a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--faint); }
  .body a:hover, .body a:focus-visible { border-bottom-color: currentColor; }

  .out { margin: 1.25rem 0 0; font-size: 0.9375rem; }
  .out span { color: var(--faint); margin-inline: 0.5rem; }
  .out a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--faint); }
  .out a:hover, .out a:focus-visible { border-bottom-color: currentColor; }
</style>
